-        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume III · Lesson 15</p>
-        <h2>CEO Agents</h2>
-        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Promote agents from coding worker bees to an adversarial CEO and board that turns a validated brief into a ranked, dissent-aware decision memo.</p>
