+        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume III · Lesson 16</p>
+        <h2>Multi-Team Agentic Coding / Lead Agents</h2>
+        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Command ten domain-locked agent experts through one Orchestrator. Learn the three-tier hierarchy, compounding memory, composable skills, config-driven scaling, and the source-level Pi runtime.</p>
