         <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">15</span><div><strong><a href="vol-3-ma/15-ceo-agents.html">CEO Agents</a></strong><p>Tactic: Agents That Decide · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
-        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">16</span><div><strong>Multi-Team Agentic Coding / Lead Agents</strong><p>Chapter pending</p></div><span class="badge badge--pending">Pending</span></div>
