+        <div class="lesson"><span class="lesson__n">16</span><div><strong><a href="vol-3-ma/16-lead-agents.html">Multi-Team Agentic Coding / Lead Agents</a></strong><p>MA-2 · Domain-locked depth-2 teams · Chapter complete</p></div><span class="badge badge--done">Done</span></div>
